      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Braum raises his shield in a direction for several seconds, intercepting all projectiles causing them to hit him and be destroyed. He negates the damage of the first attack completely and reduces the damage of all subsequent attacks from this direction.",
      "summary_zh": "布隆朝一个方向举起盾牌，持续数秒，可以拦截所有敌方飞行道具，并将它们摧毁，但自身要承受这些飞行道具的伤害。在举盾后，布隆将使承受的第一次攻击变得完全无效，并降低来自这个方向的所有后续攻击的伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1306902:4012056"
      ]
    },
